{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-contrast-05. Raw slots is a list of length 1..4 with every item an exact integer 5..9 inclusive; empty list and any out-of-range/wrong-type item are invalid. Missing and null are distinct: membership guard before reading the key, so absent key yields ok:false with slots:[]. No I/O, imports, host calls or upstream validation. Module-level result assignment on every branch. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-contrast-05", "description": "Raw slots must be a list with length 1..4 inclusive, all items exact integers 5..9 inclusive. Empty is invalid. Always result={ok:boolean,slots:original if valid else []}. No bool/float/coercion/exceptions. No I/O/imports/host calls, no upstream validation assumption. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "slots = inputs.get('slots')
